  "description": "The proposal involves the installation of three metal storage sheds and one portable DS toilet unit within the existing Young Adult Centre (YAC) site. The sheds will be used for secure storage of equipment and materials associated with the centre’s activities. The portable DS toilet will provide additional sanitary facilities for staff and visitors during peak usage periods.\nThere is no change of use to the site; it will continue to operate as a Young Adult Centre. The works are minor and intended to support the existing function of the premises.",
